    "detailed_description": "Tap to the rhythm based on the shapes that emerge!<br><br>This rhythm game features 3 main notes: Circle, Square and Triangle<br>Single tap, hold-release and double tap for the different notes respectively.<br>Try to reach the end without missing a note, or simply play through the level and test your accuracy!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 10 levels with different music<br></li><li> Increasing difficulty of notes and timings with level progression<br></li><li> 3 main modes (Normal, Hard and Accuracy)<br></li><li> Practice mode for all main modes<br></li><li> Settings customization for smoother gameplay</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Others:</h2>It is highly recommended to set your input and music offsets before playing.<br>You can also change your input key-binds to best suit your needs.",
